# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: the committed-manifest exception of this member: everything under .stackra/ is generated except the
#          contract artefacts other members build their clients from (app-manifest.json) and the OpenAPI projection.
#          Same rule set as the root .gitignore, repeated so the member folder keeps it when copied elsewhere.
# Boundary: ignore rules only.
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: ADR 0158, ADR 0268
.stackra/*
!.stackra/app-manifest.json
!.stackra/openapi.json
# template only: the generated samples are committed so they can be read; a real project drops the next line
!.stackra/**
# generated root shims (Expo CLI and EAS read the member root; each re-exports its .stackra/ file)
/app.config.ts
/babel.config.js
/metro.config.js
/eas.json
dist/
.expo/
ios/
android/
maestro-report/
